ai "Patient Runner"
about "Lets the blocks develop, reads the second level, takes the cutback."
position RB
dials vision 0.9 patience 0.8 aggression 0.5 discipline 0.7

rules:
  when with the ball and blocker ahead and time under 2s -> follow my blocker
  when with the ball and enemy within 1.5 -> stiff arm; protect the ball
  when with the ball and goal line within 6 -> race for the pylon
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  when before the throw and assignment is block -> pick up the blitz
  otherwise -> follow assignment
